From 8af852a3bec4a18ab0b66dc4c46905aa4d639c15 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gus Bourg <gus@bourg.net>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 09:14:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 117/210] staging: media: meson: vdec: remove the driver

Remove the staging decoder to make room for the Amlogic platform
driver and its stateless request API.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5 Claude:claude-fable-5.1 Codex:gpt-5.6 Codex:gpt-6.0
